{"data": [{"author_id": "14773866", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:26:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117609378727735782"], "id": "2117609378727735782", "in_reply_to_user_id": "14773866", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117605560757653505", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Interested in protecting your Grok Bot against injection attacks? Learn more about Inbox Sentry.\n\nhttps://t.co/MsMwniHuAn", "url": "https://x.com/jwilkes/status/2117609378727735782"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117607740403015680"]}, "author_id": "3037499176", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:24:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117608876275036469"], "id": "2117608876275036469", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112947495059743047", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy f*ck, Elon Musk\u2019s Grok Bot gives you 20 bots to find jobs, tailor your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 and prep interviews\n\njob hunting shouldn\u2019t eat the hours you need to prepare for the actual interview\n\n01\u201304 | Job search \u2192 live openings, fit scores, compensation\n05\u201308 | R\u00e9sum\u00e9 &amp; portfolio \u2192 https://t.co/AUbzwUsVYA https://t.co/NLfUfhFR9u", "url": "https://x.com/tsukiema_/status/2117608876275036469"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117608242876502016"]}, "author_id": "2187485293", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:22:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117608247842488498"], "id": "2117608247842488498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My review of Grok Bot\nAs a millennial, I've always prided myself on adapting to new technology without the politics getting in the way, and Grok Bot is exactly that: the next step in technology. It's the iPhone in a world of flip phones.\n\nI'm an avid tech user and everyone's home https://t.co/MoSTzeoQsf", "url": "https://x.com/XSolarEmpiresX/status/2117608247842488498"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117600046162092032"]}, "author_id": "1655853634515619841", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:18:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117607361951023325"], "id": "2117607361951023325", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117566749428138162", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Oh my f**king god, Elon Musk's SpaceXAI team just dropped 91 ready-made Grok bots, and ALL OF THEM ARE FREE RN\n\nThere's a bot that clears your inbox, a bot that hunts down unpaid invoices, a bot that phones your customers, and a bot that drives your vacuum straight from the chat. https://t.co/gllfdhFxF4 https://t.co/CtvU5e6kip", "url": "https://x.com/le0xet/status/2117607361951023325"}, {"article": {"title": "Here's how I used an AI assistant to clean up and lock down my digital life"}, "author_id": "943833312", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:17:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117607134049268173"], "id": "2117607134049268173", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/o47qiQdhvo", "url": "https://x.com/Francesco_Mussi/status/2117607134049268173"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117604051097427968"]}, "author_id": "1999974345800925184", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:05:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117604088665813235"], "id": "2117604088665813235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 160, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115018135396905000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "THIS IS F*CKING INSANE\n\nI run 7 Grok Bot agents on 1 clock and they launch products while I sleep\n\nseven hourly bots burn 1,176 runs a week asking \"anything new?\". mine do about 60, because only one bot has a schedule. everything else wakes when there is real work\n\nthe 7 agents, https://t.co/Oz4H4ApdBj https://t.co/SgA0y2jNXR", "url": "https://x.com/unknownnode404/status/2117604088665813235"}, {"author_id": "16014761", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:03:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117603633588228551"], "id": "2117603633588228551", "in_reply_to_user_id": "101584084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117536005649748050", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BrianRoemmele Here is what Grok Bot thinks after installing this setup. Requires quite a bit of training to be useful. \u2014\n\nLaya checks out and is installed on my computer in shadow mode, but untrained it isn't good enough to use for anything yet. It's the real Apache-licensed laya 0.4.21 from", "url": "https://x.com/trentmchapman/status/2117603633588228551"}, {"author_id": "2766142049", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:58:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117602232191299839"], "id": "2117602232191299839", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117463822332314036", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot next step after that call: progressive rings back with the quote and it hits your phone, not the bot's. @skysay_ai gives grok bot its own number over mcp, so it answers the callback and books the follow-up into your calendar", "url": "https://x.com/skyzer4ever/status/2117602232191299839"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117601641759141888"]}, "author_id": "2019248825777504256", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:55:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117601645949489596"], "id": "2117601645949489596", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The best time to be alive \ud83e\udd23\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude06\ud83e\udd79 I got the bots finally to coordinate via inbox , any thoughts \ud83d\udcad on better ways? Only grok bot has its own email but it went out of usage instantly even on the plus subscription \ud83d\ude44 https://t.co/WrhxSknzsm", "url": "https://x.com/Mematicmeme/status/2117601645949489596"}, {"author_id": "14958243", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:52:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117600846469062792"], "id": "2117600846469062792", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117422818648555595", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Grok Bot now handles my bookkeeping, stock, inbox and calendar across a kebab shop and a school. That's admin I'd otherwise have to hire for. Small business is where this gets real.", "url": "https://x.com/paulchapman/status/2117600846469062792"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117587080209432576"]}, "author_id": "832218563964444672", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117598920293450020"], "id": "2117598920293450020", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 514, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "2.5B Siri requests a day. Apple just put a meter on them.\n\nMy read: this is the most important AI news of the week for SpaceX holders. \n\nA company worth almost $5T just confirmed the AI price floor.\n\n1. What Apple said\n\nCEO John Ternus: Siri handles over 2.5B requests a day. https://t.co/evSiHxLH4j", "url": "https://x.com/spcxGOD/status/2117598920293450020"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117596461479104512"]}, "author_id": "1518262087037997056", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:35:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117596472996716889"], "id": "2117596472996716889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 201, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Every company needs an attention hacker.\n\nAt Gojiberry, ours is @romanbuildsaas.\n\nEvery day, he blocks off one hour to find unconventional ways to drive traffic and get people talking.\n\nHis calendar literally says \u201cSTUPID GROWTH STUFF.\u201d\n\nBehind the name is a serious habit: making https://t.co/e9mnqLikMy", "url": "https://x.com/Dylan_txa_/status/2117596472996716889"}, {"author_id": "2058470843857190912", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:35:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117596407922397230"], "id": "2117596407922397230", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "tim SpaceXAI baru share 91 Grok Bot dan semuanya gratis.\n\nada yang baca inbox lu. ada yang nagih invoice yang belum dibayar. ada yang nelpon customer lu. ada juga yang nyalain robot vacuum dari chat.\n\n56 bot resmi di halaman use cases\n35 lagi di marketplace\n\nbot kayak gini", "url": "https://x.com/stpete69/status/2117596407922397230"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117595463243464705", "3_2117595468226293760"]}, "author_id": "1699889909627269120", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:31:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117595474987495568"], "id": "2117595474987495568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 787, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117242768137580663", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "SpaceXSI: Grok Bot Daily Preview\nGrok Bot upcoming updates, spotted in prerelease builds since yesterday (1.1.0-pre.13 \u2192 pre.16)\n\n\ud83d\udc65 Sharing and teams:\n\u2705 Teams admin approval\n\ud83d\udd10 Bot vault\n\ud83e\udd1d Personal or shared Bot\n\ud83e\udde9 Pre-share disclosure\n\n\ud83d\udcde Calls:\n\ud83e\udd16 Agent tool access\n\n\ud83d\udd0c https://t.co/paPRODK8yR https://t.co/1GwCTStWh4", "url": "https://x.com/blankspeaker/status/2117595474987495568"}, {"author_id": "1614958779489026048", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:30:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117595316039844169"], "id": "2117595316039844169", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A subscriber once apologized to me for leaving my list. The email she replied to was automated.\n\nShe said she was \"really sorry\": an injury meant she was leaving.\n\n8 rules that make automated emails feel handwritten, plus a prompt that rewrites yours:\n\nMost people leave without a", "url": "https://x.com/0xPaulvibe/status/2117595316039844169"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117590305641766912"]}, "author_id": "2052794780501901312", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:11:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117590586311975122"], "id": "2117590586311975122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 370, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117264989014618503", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "YOU GO TO SLEEP. YOUR AI GOES TO WORK.\n\nThat's the idea behind one of the most interesting Grok Bot workflows I've seen.\n\nBefore bed, you give it one instruction:\n\n\"What can you work on for the next 8 hours that moves us toward this week's goal? Draft everything. Send nothing.\" https://t.co/7KxQj4AfKW https://t.co/mgUvNSleca", "url": "https://x.com/bykushnir/status/2117590586311975122"}, {"author_id": "1732170258830524416", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117587849013051820"], "id": "2117587849013051820", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "your grok bot usage ran out early this week?\n\naudit before you quit.\n\n&gt; ask any bot: \"what used my usage this week, by activity?\"\n&gt; find routines firing more often than the job needs. hourly checks that could be daily\n&gt; pause what you don't need right now. the routine stays", "url": "https://x.com/perpycode/status/2117587849013051820"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117327434404315136"]}, "author_id": "2073300627443032064", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117587612789875089"], "id": "2117587612789875089", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 568, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115443090068516935", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "GROK BOT + OBSIDIAN DOES THE WORK OF A WHOLE RESEARCH TEAM\n$30/MONTH VS $200K/YEAR IN SALARIES\n\none vault, 6 bots on a schedule, and you only show up twice a day to approve\n\nthe hidden trick: the vault is a zettelkasten\nevery note links to its neighbors, so by week 8 it feels https://t.co/LBZTao6DYe https://t.co/hvovLYWCuH", "url": "https://x.com/irongiantXBT/status/2117587612789875089"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117484066929012736"]}, "author_id": "2098249271330086913", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117587600458293300"], "id": "2117587600458293300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Wang wants less #AI fluff. #OpenAI  #DOTS  is rolling out texting.\n\nHere\u2019s my test for a personal agent: does it reduce my mental load\u2014or become another inbox I manage?\n\nAt #ALPHAWALK, we want fewer things to supervise.\nWould you let your AI text you\u2014or mute it?\n#agent #Muse https://t.co/AEQpydCiVJ", "url": "https://x.com/ALPHAWALKHQ/status/2117587600458293300"}, {"author_id": "1918346924463202304", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:59:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117587390051098650"], "id": "2117587390051098650", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1918346924463202304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 142, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117587384380313650", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "paste this into a new Grok Bot:\n\n&lt;prompt&gt;\n&lt;role&gt; You are Grok Bot, my team architect and setup partner. Most people run one bot in one chat. I want the opposite: a small crew of bots that shares one cloud computer, one skill library and one memory, so whatever I set up once,", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2117587390051098650"}, {"article": {"title": "How we run a human + AI team in one workspace"}, "author_id": "2041470748032716800", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:47:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117584415962669256"], "id": "2117584415962669256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 367, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our agents use different runtimes and clients, including Hermes, OpenClaw, ChatGPT, Claude and Grok. Each connection needs a job, access to the right material and a way to pick up the next request. https://t.co/1WNT8Ceab9", "url": "https://x.com/actvox/status/2117584415962669256"}, {"author_id": "1652751475179749378", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:42:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117583188721836218"], "id": "2117583188721836218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117307611338997846", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI asked 3,995 people what they would most want a personal assistant to do for them and built a new test called LifeVal around the answers, with jobs like finding childcare or ordering groceries on a budget.\n\nI use Grok Bot a lot, so i really like this eval. https://t.co/mgnXragMuP", "url": "https://x.com/1Matsapen/status/2117583188721836218"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117582045274628097"]}, "author_id": "2112479295410999297", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:39:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117582322199400896"], "id": "2117582322199400896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 294, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114671097459183871", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i turned my 11 grok bots into a subway map and i'm never opening 11 chats again\n\none prompt. about 1% of my weekly usage. save this\n\nevery team is a line. every bot is a train. every step of its job is a station\n\nin the middle there's one station called YOU\n\nany bot that needs my https://t.co/RnHeM2t0ew https://t.co/O29Du9VtJP", "url": "https://x.com/0xTeddet/status/2117582322199400896"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117578078155345920"]}, "author_id": "1366752206058180608", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:22:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117578217196528122"], "id": "2117578217196528122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 202, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "hiring for every boring job in your week isn't an option, so most of it just doesn't get done.\n\nxai put up a page of ready-made grok bot agents you add in one click: inbox manager, invoice coordinator, apartment scout, subscription cleaner.\n\n56 of them so far, sorted by job. https://t.co/dyWKN7hmEj", "url": "https://x.com/victor_explore/status/2117578217196528122"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117577613363294208"]}, "author_id": "50464905", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:20:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117